From 083762a82ad82316350cd7e4ba1f3f06b1439457 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mikekinney@Mikes-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:11:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(ui): zoom and fit the tool editor's 3D body preview

Wheel or pinch (Ctrl+wheel) over the preview zooms about the cursor,
clamped to 1/4x..32x of the fit view; double-click or the new Fit
button resets orbit, zoom and pan. Drag still orbits. View state only.
The decision file records the zoom and the whole-tool simulation
drawing.

Refs #371

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
